pulation of 97 regions, with\n113\t83 standing open under some cut and agreeing with the host; adding 800 upstream carriers opens twelve\n114\tmore), 16 (move, never lose — and carry the reader-keyed report routing note with it, which no test\n115\tholds), 17 (verify by building a .vsix first; same missing package→needed direction as item 1).\n116\tYANG's own items YIN did not touch: the collider invariant's false green (name matched in a comment,\n117\tclause matched elsewhere; the real collider is excellent and invisible — one-line fix, strip comments\n118\tbefore the name match); two of the 49 gates writing tracked files so the report is not read-only;\n119\tfour CI-blocking instruments outside the collider requirement, one with no test at all; nothing\n120\tcollides the 39 invariants and no ruling says why; the deliberate absences (the within-construct\n121\twitness, the unarticulated fragment) and the two throwaway scouts that are the only implementation of\n122\tthe continuity reading — all of which look exactly like gaps and dead code and are neither.\n123\t\n124\t## THE BLIND SPOT YIN MADE VISIBLE TO YANG\n125\tThe record and the harness have NO SYNTAX for \"this number was true when measured\" versus \"this number\n126\tis true now\", and every staleness finding in both reports is downstream of that one absence. Arrived at\n127\tfrom four directions: a ledger row stating 585/122/247 against the certified 556/110/245 while\n128\tnarrating a sequence; two restatements saying 111 for 110 in welded files in shapes the weld's patterns\n129\tdo not match; 106 figures of N-of-65 or a percentage in the welded section with ZERO read by anything\n130\tand only 6 machine-readable twins in the whole repository; and three harness doc-comment derivations\n131\tthat reproduce in rank and ratio but not in integer.\n132\tCURE, one mark: a dated reading carries its date, a live claim carries a machine-readable twin, and a\n133\tfigure carrying neither fails its gate. That si